  "charsetNote": "The model's token inventory is the 94-character train charset (62 case-sensitive alphanumeric + 32 punctuation). Upstream's test-time CharsetAdapter would additionally filter predictions to configs/main.yaml's 36-character lowercase charset_test; this probe records the tokenizer's own decode as the raw transcript and does not apply that downstream filter, so the recorded output is the model's sequence output rather than a filtered view of it."
